  "id": "caramel-pecan-frozen-dessert",
  "name": "Caramel Pecan Frozen Dessert",
  "subtitle": "A layered chilled dessert with a crisp crumb base and creamy caramel filling.",
  "description": "Bake the crumb base and pecan-oat mixture, then layer them with a smooth cream cheese filling and freeze until firm.",
